  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 902.26 “Replacement” as applied to a stream crossing means the removal of all or a portion of an existing legal structure and the installation of a new structure or new portion of the structure that does not qualify as a repair or a replacement in-kind.\n\nSource. #12809, eff 12-15-19",
